#: src/iterators/enumerate.md:1
msgid "`enumerate`"
msgstr ""

#: src/iterators/enumerate.md:3
msgid ""
"The [`enumerate`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/iter/trait.Iterator."
"html#method.enumerate) helper gives us a way to get the index of each "
"element for any iterator."
msgstr ""

